        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial will be added in the next update.<br><br>Hello medieval enthusiasts! I’m an solo-independent developer. Every idea, suggestion, or piece of feedback you share will help me shape and improve the game. Let’s develop this game together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an alchemist-medicus, running your own potion workshop in a medieval town. Brew potions, gather rare ingredients, and tend to an ever-growing line of townsfolk in need of your healing brews.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're refining ancient recipes, crafting new potions, or organizing your shelves with care, each day brings new rhythms to master. Expand your humble infirmary, hire skilled assistants, and adapt to changing demands in a world that rewards both strategy and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet dawns spent gathering herbs to hectic evenings curing the sick, your journey from village healer to legendary medicus begins now.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft dozens of unique potions using herbs, minerals, and rare ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize and expand your infirmary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Serve a variety of medieval characters, each with unique needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Balance inventory, economy and reputation to grow your business</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover new recipes, research upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing yet strategic gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Isometric art style set in a medieval atmosphere<br><br>contact dev <a href=\"mailto:kocafurkandincaslan@gmail.com\">kocafurkandincaslan@gmail.com</a><br>Update 1:    <br>Volume slider added <br>Fixed issue where the game would freeze when running in the background. <br> <br>Update 2:<br>Economy adjusted, potion and area prices rebalanced<br>Save/Load issue fixed<br>Bug with Toothache Draught and Human Poison research fixed</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial will be added in the next update.<br><br>Hello medieval enthusiasts! I’m an solo-independent developer. Every idea, suggestion, or piece of feedback you share will help me shape and improve the game. Let’s develop this game together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an alchemist-medicus, running your own potion workshop in a medieval town. Brew potions, gather rare ingredients, and tend to an ever-growing line of townsfolk in need of your healing brews.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're refining ancient recipes, crafting new potions, or organizing your shelves with care, each day brings new rhythms to master. Expand your humble infirmary, hire skilled assistants, and adapt to changing demands in a world that rewards both strategy and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet dawns spent gathering herbs to hectic evenings curing the sick, your journey from village healer to legendary medicus begins now.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft dozens of unique potions using herbs, minerals, and rare ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize and expand your infirmary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Serve a variety of medieval characters, each with unique needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Balance inventory, economy and reputation to grow your business</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover new recipes, research upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing yet strategic gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Isometric art style set in a medieval atmosphere<br><br>contact dev <a href=\"mailto:kocafurkandincaslan@gmail.com\">kocafurkandincaslan@gmail.com</a><br>Update 1:    <br>Volume slider added <br>Fixed issue where the game would freeze when running in the background. <br> <br>Update 2:<br>Economy adjusted, potion and area prices rebalanced<br>Save/Load issue fixed<br>Bug with Toothache Draught and Human Poison research fixed</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Step into the role of a medieval medicus! Manage your own medieval potion shop! Craft potions, serve customers, expand your workspace, and grow your reputation in a relaxing isometric simulation with strategic resource management.",
